    "reputation": 4000
   },
   "body": "<p>Maybe restart the server?</p>"
  },
  {
   "answer_id": 910011,
   "question_id": 900011,
   "score": 150,
   "is_accepted": true,
   "creation_date": 1617364800,
   "content_license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
   "owner": {
    "display_name": "Test Answerer 5",
    "link": "https://example.org/test-fixture/users/5",
    "user_type": "registered",
    "reputation": 5000
   },
   "body": "<p>There is no package called cv2 — the import name cv2 comes from the opencv-python package. Install it into the interpreter you run:</p><pre><code>python -m pip install opencv-python</code></pre>"
  },
  {
   "answer_id": 910012,
   "question_id": 900012,
   "score": 40,
   "is_accepted": true,
   "creation_date": 1662897600,
   "content_license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
   "owner": {
    "display_name": "Test Answerer 6",
    "link": "https://example.org/test-fixture/users/6",
    "user_type": "registered",
    "reputation": 6000
   },
   "body": "<p>The notebook runs another interpreter. Install it into that kernel from a cell:</p><pre><code>%pip install opencv-python</code></pre>"
  },
  {
   "answer_id": 910021,
   "question_id": 900021,
   "score": 95,
   "is_accepted": true,
   "creation_date": 1738584000,
   "content_license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
   "owner": {
    "display_name": "Test Answerer 7",
    "link": "https://example.org/test-fixture/users/7",
    "user_type": "registered",
    "reputation": 7000
   },
   "body": "<p>Upgrade the package that pins the old peer dependency; only as a last resort install with --legacy-peer-deps.</p><pre><code>npm install --legacy-peer-deps</code></pre>"
  }
